mplete breakdown of <strong>Liebert AC repair charges Vadodara</strong> before we touch a single capacitor. We explain technical issues—like humidity sensor drift or logic board shorts—in plain language. Experience the difference of a professional squad that values your uptime as much as you do.\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <section id=\"services\" class=\"py-16 bg-gray-50 rounded-3xl my-12\">\n            <div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12\">\n                <div class=\"text-center mb-16\">\n                    <h2 class=\"font-['Poppins',sans-serif] font-extrabold text-[#1A202C] relative inline-block after:content-[''] after:absolute after:-bottom-2.5 after:left-1/2 after:-translate-x-1/2 after:w-[60px] after:h-1 after:bg-[#D4AF37] after:rounded-sm text-3xl md:text-5xl mb-6\">Our Precision Interventions</h2>\n                    <p class=\"text-xl text-gray-600 max-w-3xl mx-auto mt-4\">Restoring technical balance to high-performance cooling infrastructure.</p>\n                </div>\n                \n                <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-10\">\n                    <article class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-gray-100 shadow-lg group transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-2.5 hover:shadow-[0_20px_40px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\">\n                        <div class=\"relative h-56 overflow-hidden\">\n                            <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-[#1A202C]/20 group-hover:bg-transparent transition-colors z-10\"></div>\n                            <img decoding=\"async\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover transform group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-700\" src=\"https://atlasaircons.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/ac-repairing-in-vadodara.webp\" alt=\"General Liebert AC Repair Vadodara\" onerror=\"handleImageError(this)\" title=\"\">\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"p-8 flex flex-col h-[calc(100%-14rem)]\">\n                            <div class=\"bg-[#D4AF37]/10 w-14 h-14 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center text-[#D4AF37] text-2xl mb-6 shadow-sm\"><i class=\"fas fa-microscope\"></i></div>\n                            <h3 class=\"text-xl font-['Poppins',sans-serif] font-bold text-[#1A202C] mb-3 mt-0\">System Diagnostics</h3>\n                            <p class=\"text-gray-600 mb-6 line-clamp-3 text-sm\">If your Liebert unit is tripping breakers or showing sensor errors, we provide a full forensic health check. We handle all <strong>Liebert split AC repair Vadodara</strong> work with high-precision resistance testers to ensure factory performance is restored.</p>\n                            <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-t border-gray-100 pt-4 mt-auto\">\n                                <span class=\"text-lg font-bold text-[#D4AF37]\">From ₹399</span>\n                                <a href=\"tel:+919727257141\" class=\"text-[#1A202C] font-semibold hover:text-[#D4AF37] transition-colors flex items-center no-underline\">Call Now <i class=\"fas fa-phone-alt ml-2 text-sm\"></i></a>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </article>\n\n                    <article class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-gray-100 shadow-lg group transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-2.5 hover:shadow-[0_20px_40px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\">\n                        <div class=\"relative h-56 overflow-hidden bg-gray-900 flex items-center justify-center\">\n                            <i class=\"fas fa-industry text-6xl text-[#D4AF37] opacity-80 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-700\"></i>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"p-8 flex flex-col h-[calc(100%-14rem)]\">\n                            <div class=\"bg-[#D4AF37]/10 w-14 h-14 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center text-[#D4AF37] text-2xl mb-6 shadow-sm\"><i class=\"fas fa-industry\"></i></div>\n                            <h3 class=\"text-xl font-['Poppins',sans-serif] font-bold text-[#1A202C] mb-3 mt-0\">Industrial Panel AC Repair</h3>\n                            <p class=\"text-gray-600 mb-6 line-clamp-3 text-sm\">Server cabinets and CNC control panels produce massive heat load. Our engineers provide expert <strong>Liebert panel AC repair Vadodara</strong>. We prevent equipment shutdown by ensuring your thermal protection remains 100% active.</p>\n                            <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-t border-gray-100 pt-4 mt-auto\">\n                                <span class=\"text-lg font-bold text-[#D4AF37]\">From ₹1500</span>\n                                <a href=\"tel:+919727257141\" class=\"text-[#1A202C] font-semibold hover:text-[#D4AF37] transition-colors flex items-center no-underline\">Call Now <i class=\"fas fa-phone-alt ml-2 text-sm\"></i></a>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </article>\n\n                    <article class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-gray-100 shadow-lg group transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-2.5 hover:shadow-[0_20px_40px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\">\n                        <div class=\"relative h-56 overflow-hidden\">\n                            <img decoding=\"async\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover transform group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-700\" src=\"https://atlasaircons.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/Ac-circuit.webp\" alt=\"Component level Liebert AC PCB Repair Vadodara\" title=\"\">\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"p-8 flex flex-col h-[calc(100%-14rem)]\">\n                            <div class=\"bg-[#D4AF37]/10 w-14 h-14 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center text-[#D4AF37] text-2xl mb-6 shadow-sm\"><i class=\"fas fa-microchip\"></i></div>\n                            <h3 class=\"text-xl font-['Poppins',sans-serif] font-bold text-[#1A202C] mb-3 mt-0\">PCB Logic Restoration</h3>\n                            <p class=\"text-gray-600 mb-6 line-clamp-3 text-sm\">Precision AC logic boards are incredibly complex. We specialize in <strong>Liebert AC PCB repair Vadodara</strong>, performing component replacement on your original board to restore logic function for a fraction of the cost of a new motherboard.</p>\n                            <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-t border-gray-100 pt-4 mt-auto\">\n                                <span class=\"text-lg font-bold text-[#D4AF37]\">From ₹1500</span>\n                                <a href=\"tel:+919727257141\" class=\"text-[#1A202C] font-semibold hover:text-[#D4AF37] transition-colors flex items-center no-underline\">Call Now <i class=\"fas fa-phone-alt ml-2 text-sm\"></i></a>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </article>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <section id=\"guide\" class=\"py-16 bg-white relative overflow-hidden\">\n            <div class=\"absolute right-0 top-0 w-1/3 h-full bg-yellow-50/50 skew-x-12 transform origin-top-right z-0\"></div>\n            <div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10 max-w-6xl\">\n                <div class=\"text-center mb-16\">\n                    <h2 class=\"font-['Poppins',sans-serif] font-extrabold text-[#1A202C] relative inline-block after:content-[''] after:absolute after:-bottom-2.5 after:left-1/2 after:-translate-x-1/2 after:w-[60px] after:h-1 after:bg-[#D4AF37] after:rounded-sm text-3xl md:text-5xl mb-6\">Securing Critical Infrastructure</h2>\n                    <p class=\"text-xl text-gray-600 max-w-3xl mx-auto mt-4\">Precision air conditioners require a higher level of vigilance. Here is the technical checklist for Liebert health.</p>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"space-y-12 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed text-lg text-justify md:text-left\">\n                    <div>\n                        <h3 class=\"text-2xl font-['Poppins',sans-serif] font-bold text-[#1A202C] mb-4 flex items-center\"><i class=\"fas fa-temperature-low text-blue-500 mr-3\"></i> 1. Managing Ambient Air Choke</h3>\n                        <p class=\"mb-4\">\n                            In a data center environment, dust is an absolute killer. When clients ask, &#8220;<strong>why is my Liebert AC not cooling?</strong>&#8220;, the answer is frequently found in the filter media. Precision cooling units move much larger volumes of air than domestic units. If the filters are partially blocked, the system’s high-efficiency compressor starts over-revving to compensate for the air starvation.\n                        </p>\n                        <p>\n                            Regular <strong>Liebert AC filter media replacement</strong> is critical. Unlike mesh filters that can be washed, precision units often use rated media that must be replaced to ensure moisture control and heat absorption remain consistent.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div>\n                        <h3 class=\"text-2xl font-['Poppins',sans-serif] font-bold text-[#1A202C] mb-4 flex items-center\"><i class=\"fas fa-hand-holding-water text-green-500 mr-3\"></i> 2. Humidity Control Logic</h3>\n                        <p class=\"mb-4\">\n                            Liebert units manage both temperature and humidity. In Vadodara, high humidity levels can put a massive load on the reheat and dehumidification circuits. If you notice water pooling or high humidity alarms, your unit’s internal drain pump or sensors may be failing.\n                        </p>\n                        <p>\n                            Our process for <strong>Liebert AC gas filling in Vadodara</strong> always includes a check of the expansion valves and humidity probes. We ensure the refrigerant sub-cooling is perfect so that your system manages moisture as efficiently as it manages heat.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <section class=\"py-16 bg-gray-900 text-white rounded-3xl my-12\">\n            <div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 max-w-6xl py-12\">\n                <div class=\"text-center mb-16\">\n                    <h2 class=\"font-['Poppins',sans-serif] font-extrabold text-white relative inline-block after:content-[''] after:absolute after:-bottom-2.5 after:left-1/2 after:-translate-x-1/2 after:w-[60px] after:h-1 after:bg-[#D4AF37] after:rounded-sm text-3xl md:text-5xl mb-6 text-white m-0\">Diagnostic Fault Matrix</h2>\n                    <p class=\"text-xl text-gray-400 max-w-3xl mx-auto mt-6\">Is your control panel flashing an alarm? Here is the technical guide to common <strong>Liebert AC error codes</strong>.</p>\n                </div>\n                \n                <div class=\"bg-gray-800 rounded-2xl shadow-2xl overflow-hidden border border-gray-700\">\n                    <div class=\"overflow-x-auto\">\n                        <table class=\"w-full text-left border-collapse m-0 text-sm md:text-base\">\n                            <thead>\n                                <tr class=\"bg-gray-950 text-gray-300 text-sm uppercase tracking-wider\">\n                                    <th class=\"p-6 font-semibold w-1/6\">Display Code</th>\n                                    <th class=\"p-6 font-semibold w-1/3\">Technical Fault</th>\n                                    <th class=\"p-6 font-semibold w-1/2\">Required Action</th>\n                                </tr>\n                            </thead>\n                            <tbody class=\"divide-y divide-gray-700 text-base\">\n                                <tr class=\"hover:bg-gray-700/50 transition-colors\">\n                                    <td class=\"p-6 font-black text-[#D4AF37] text-xl\">High Temp</td>\n                                    <td class=\"p-6 font-medium text-gray-300\">Return Air Overheat</td>\n                                    <td class=\"p-6 text-gray-400\">The machine cannot remove heat fast enough. Check for blocked filters or a failing blower motor. Requires a professional technical scan.</td>\n                                </tr>\n                                <tr class=\"hover:bg-gray-700/50 transition-colors bg-gray-800/30\">\n                                    <td class=\"p-6 font-black text-[#D4AF37] text-xl\">Low Pres</td>\n                                    <td class=\"p-6 font-medium text-gray-300\">Refrigerant Leakage</td>\n                                    <td class=\"p-6 text-gray-400\">Suction pressure is below safety thresholds. Shut the system down to save the compressor. Leak testing and <strong>Liebert AC gas filling</strong> are mandatory.</td>\n                                </tr>\n                                <tr class=\"hover:bg-gray-700/50 transition-colors\">\n                                    <td class=\"p-6 font-black text-[#D4AF37] text-xl\">Loss Flow</td>\n                                    <td class=\"p-6 font-medium text-gray-300\">Airflow Failure</td>\n                                    <td class=\"p-6 text-gray-400\">The fan blower is stalled or the drive belt has snapped. This is a critical error that requires immediate technical intervention.</td>\n                                </tr>\n                            </tbody>\n                        </table>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <section id=\"pricing\" class=\"py-16 bg-white\">\n            <div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 max-w-5xl\">\n                <div class=\"text-center mb-16\">\n                    <h2 class=\"font-['Poppins',sans-serif] font-extrabold te